    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a part-time job taking photos of anomalies in the night in Shinjuku.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four rules for your part-time job.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see a anomaly, take a picture of it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When taking a picture, get close to a anomaly to an appropriate distance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, don't get too close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run out of film, come back.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short horror visual novel game. It has multiple endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scheduled release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within 2025</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is fictional and has no connection to any real people, incidents, or organizations.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a part-time job taking photos of anomalies in the night in Shinjuku.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four rules for your part-time job.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see a anomaly, take a picture of it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When taking a picture, get close to a anomaly to an appropriate distance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, don't get too close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run out of film, come back.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short horror visual novel game. It has multiple endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scheduled release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within 2025</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is fictional and has no connection to any real people, incidents, or organizations.</p>",
